    <briefdescription>
<para>Helper class to define a reduction operator attached to a type of data instance. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Defining a new operator requires to define the virtual methods op and init_op which respectively initialize a data instance, and apply the reduction operator over two instances. </para>
